<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial">{!Contact.FirstName},</font><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">I hope you are having a great start to 2018.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">I wanted to reach out to you here in the month of January, and my thought it that it would be a good idea for us to jump on a 5-10 minute call (longer if needed, obviously) just to touch base and talk about your investment plans for the first half of this year.</font></div><div><font face="arial" style="background-color: rgb(102, 255, 255);"><b><br></b></font></div><div><span style="background-color: rgb(102, 255, 255);"><b><a href="https://my-schedule.timetrade.com/app/td-1259187/workflows/rzlm2/schedule/availability?wfsid=16a5bea0-baba97f6-16a5bdc5-baba97f6-00000003-akh1jtljgb2avjcra3athdno4hnubpbd&amp;view=full&amp;fs=1">Please use this link to schedule a call with me</a> </b></span>on the day/time of your choosing, and feel free to reply to this email if you want to send over specific questions, topics, etc., that you would like to cover on our call.</div><div><br></div><div>For your convenience, I am attaching a typical property from each of our 5 markets so that you can get your bearings as to the typical price points and returns for each markets, and to make it EVEN easier, here is a quick summary:</div><div><br></div><div><b><u><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Memphis &amp; Little Rock:</span> </u></b>$100-150k price range, most properties right around 7% net cash on cash return (unleveraged). little to no appreciation. our "steady eddie" markets.</div><div><br></div><div><u><b style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Oklahoma City:</b></u> $125-175k, with most properties yielding 6.5% to 7% on a cash purchase. moderate growth potential for rents and property values.</div><div><b><u><br></u></b></div><div><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"><b><u>Dallas and Houston:</u></b> </span>$150-200k, with ROI ranging from 5.75%-6.5% on average. high growth potential, ESPECIALLY at such an affordable entry point of $150k.</div><div><br></div><div>I'm looking forward to assisting you to build upon your portfolio with our team in 2018.</div><div><br></div><div>Sincerely,</div><div><br></div><div>Marq</div><div><br></div><div><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">--&nbsp;</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div class="m_8523323097983588493gmail_signature" data-smartmail="gmail_signature" style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div style="border-collapse: separate; font-size: small; font-family: georgia, serif;"><br><div dir="ltr" style="margin-left: 1.5pt;"><table style="border: none; border-collapse: collapse;"><colgroup><col width="209"><col width="217"></colgroup><tbody><tr style="height: 0pt;"><td style="font-family: arial, sans-serif; margin: 0px; border-width: 1pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><img src="https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/35Bpxe6cI59b7SPd1Ls3kCrKpkmOaeSlmXP5Cvr_dTlqpQ_NaEFimCr0Ptt6OKA5X8LT7AOk9kkY3lxI4bGUQtXBbZSp-UdEeVW2yNcMLvA6WC-7_50X5mHg09uMFju18M3oavOM" width="185" height="134" class="CToWUd a6T" tabindex="0" style="cursor: pointer; outline: 0px; border: none;"></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center;"><font color="#1155cc" face="Trebuchet MS"><span style="font-size: 12px; white-space: pre-wrap;"><b><a href="http://info.memphisinvest.com/marq-cobb-one-to-one" target="_blank" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=http://info.memphisinvest.com/marq-cobb-one-to-one&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1516313119431000&amp;usg=AFQjCNEV8ghCc47Q9cNRRAsTQRTHvEJqzQ" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);">Get to Know Marq Cobb</a></b></span></font><br></p></td><td style="font-family: arial, sans-serif; margin: 0px; border-width: 1pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Georgia; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Marq Cobb</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Georgia; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Sr. Portfolio Advisor</span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Georgia; color: rgb(116, 27, 71); vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> </span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 9pt; font-family: Georgia; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Cell: <a href="tel:(901)%20481-6842" value="+19014816842" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);">901.481.6842</a></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 9pt; font-family: Georgia; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Office Direct: </span><span style="font-size: 9pt; font-family: Georgia; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><a href="tel:(901)%20505-0723" value="+19015050723" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);">901.505.0723</a></span></p><b